sequenceDiagram
    participant OL as Microsoft Outlook
    participant N8N as n8n Engine
    participant OLLAMA as Ollama
    participant FS as Local Filesystem
    participant QD as Qdrant

    OL->>N8N: New email (poll trigger)
    rect rgb(225, 245, 254)
    N8N->>N8N: Dedup check (static data)
    N8N->>N8N: Strip HTML and thread history
    end
    N8N->>OLLAMA: Stage 1 - Classify (qwen2.5:7b-instruct)
    OLLAMA-->>N8N: JSON {intent, product_name, ...}
    N8N->>N8N: Parse JSON, route by intent
    N8N->>FS: Read Excel binary file
    FS-->>N8N: Binary data
    N8N->>N8N: Parse spreadsheet (Inventory / Deliveries)
    N8N->>N8N: Match product (Tier 1: exact)
    alt Exact match found
        N8N->>N8N: Use exact match
    else No exact match
        N8N->>N8N: Match product (Tier 2: substring)
        alt Substring match found
            N8N->>N8N: Use substring match
        else No substring match
            N8N->>OLLAMA: Embed query (bge-m3)
            OLLAMA-->>N8N: Query vector
            N8N->>QD: Search inventory_products
            QD-->>N8N: Top results with scores
            N8N->>N8N: Check score >= 0.82 and gap >= 0.05
        end
    end
    rect rgb(225, 245, 254)
    N8N->>N8N: Compose data packet
    end
    N8N->>OLLAMA: Stage 2 - Draft reply (qwen2.5:7b-instruct)
    OLLAMA-->>N8N: Draft text
    rect rgb(225, 245, 254)
    N8N->>N8N: Scrub formatting
    N8N->>N8N: Compose subject
    end
    N8N->>OL: Create draft reply
    N8N->>N8N: Mark message processed
